# TeacherBOY / Ms. Green - Agent Instructions

## Project Overview
**TeacherBOY** (branded as **Ms. Green**) is a **multi-agent LINE/Telegram translation bot** deployed on **HuggingFace Spaces** via Docker. Built with **Python 3.11**, **FastAPI**, **LINE Bot SDK v3**, and **async/await** throughout.

**Key constraint:** NEVER use the Maton AI API key in this project (Hermes agent uses it separately).

---

## Architecture

### Core Components
| Layer | Responsibility |
|-------|----------------|
| **FastAPI App** (`src/main.py`) | HTTP server, LINE webhook handler, lifespan management |
| **Agent Router** (`src/agents/agent_router.py`) | Priority-based dispatch to registered agents |
| **Agents** (`src/agents/`) | Self-contained handlers for specific domains |
| **Services** (`src/services/`) | Singletons for business logic (LLM, translation, calendar, memory, etc.) |
| **Config** (`src/config.py`) | Pydantic Settings - ALL env vars validated at startup |
| **Prompts** (`src/prompts/`) | System prompts & psychological frameworks (FBI BAU, Ekman FACS, Navarro) |

