## LLM Provider Fallback Chain
**Priority order (configurable via `LLM_FALLBACK_PROVIDER_PRIORITY`):**
```
gemini → hermes → openrouter → hf_inference → github → ollama
```
All providers use **OpenAI-compatible API format**. See `src/utils/llm_fallback.py` and individual services (`gemini_service.py`, `openrouter_service.py`, `hermes_service.py`, `nous_service.py`, `github_models_service.py`).

