## Persistent Storage (HuggingFace Hub)
| Feature | Local Path | HF Repo Setting |
|---------|------------|-----------------|
| Conversation Memory | `./data/conversations` | `HF_MEMORY_REPO_ID` |
| Calendar Events | `./data/calendar` | `CALENDAR_HF_REPO_ID` |
| Documents (PDF/DOCX) | `./data/documents` | `DOCUMENT_HF_REPO_ID` |
| History Logs | `./data/logs` | `HISTORY_LOG_HF_REPO_ID` |
| Mod Audit Logs | `./data/mod_audit` | Same as history logs |
| Bot Identity | `./data/bot_identity` | N/A (local only) |

**Startup:** `StartupLoader.ensure_data_loaded()` blocks until all HF data is synced locally (prevents "empty state" on cold start).

