## Critical Patterns

### Agent Routing Flow
```
MessageEvent → AgentRouter.route_message()
  → sorted by priority (lowest first)
  → agent.should_handle(event, text) [fast boolean check]
  → agent.handle(event, text, line_bot_api) [actual processing]
  → returns True if handled, else continues to next agent
```

### LLM Call Pattern (with fallback)
```python
from src.services.openrouter_service import openrouter_service
from src.services.gemini_service import gemini_service
from src.utils.llm_fallback import hermes_service

# Try primary, then fallback chain automatically handled by each service
response = await openrouter_service.chat_completion(messages, model="...")
# or
response = await gemini_service.chat_completion(messages)
```

### Configuration Access
```python
from src.config import settings

# Simple values
settings.line_channel_access_token
settings.openrouter_default_model

# Parsed lists
settings.get_admin_user_ids()  # → list[str]
settings.is_conversation_memory_hf_configured()  # → bool
```

### Logging
```python
import logging
logger = logging.getLogger(__name__)

logger.info(f"✅ {message}")      # Success
logger.warning(f"⚠️  {message}")  # Non-fatal issue
logger.error(f"❌ {message}", exc_info=True)  # Error with traceback
```

