## Do's and Don'ts

### ✅ DO
- Use `async/await` for all I/O
- Add type hints to all functions
- Register agents in `main.py` lifespan with correct priority
- Use existing singleton services via import
- Write tests for new agents/services
- Follow Ruff formatting (line-length 127, double quotes)

### ❌ DON'T
- Use Maton AI API key anywhere in this project
- Make synchronous HTTP calls (use `httpx.AsyncClient` from `main.py` pool)
- Create new service instances - use module-level singletons
- Hardcode configuration - add to `config.py` Settings
- Block the event loop (no `time.sleep()`, `requests.get()`, etc.)
- Commit `.env` or secrets

